The problem seems to be in the save button function:

$.post(pluginRoot + &apos;/&apos; + $(this).attr(&apos;__pid&apos;) + &apos;?&apos; + $(this).find(&apos;form&apos;).serialize(), function() {
			// reload on success - prevents AJAX errors - see FELIX-3116
			document.location.href = pluginRoot; 
		});

Here the form is serialized and appended to the request URL. This is wrong. The serialized form must be transmitted as part of the request body.

